    {
      "id": "claim_971e76f422034bc993fd7b477c4c5aca",
      "statement": "The crates.io publish job runs `cargo publish --token ${{ secrets.CARGO_REGISTRY_TOKEN }}` after installing libdbus/pkg-config (the crate must compile to publish), which fails loudly if the tag's version was already published so a re-run cannot silently no-op; only versions carried by main when the tag is pushed get published, since the tag sits on the release merge into main.",
