      "statement": "The OpenWiki bot opens its PR via peter-evans/create-pull-request (pinned to the v7 commit SHA) from branch `openwiki/update` onto `development`, with add-paths limited to `openwiki`, `AGENTS.md`, and `CLAUDE.md` and commit message/title `docs: update OpenWiki` — so bot-maintained agent-rule files ride along with the wiki output.",
