    {
      "id": "claim_7c644904a66d445ea88624419d783a65",
      "statement": "strix-pentest.yml is manual-only (workflow_dispatch with a scan_mode input defaulting to quick — no PR trigger, because Strix scans consume substantial OpenRouter credits and may run for many minutes): it checks out with full history, installs Strix via the strix.ai installer, and runs `strix -n -t ./ --scan-mode \"${{ inputs.scan_mode || 'quick' }}\"` with STRIX_LLM hardcoded to openai/gpt-5.6-luna, LLM_API_KEY mapped to the existing OPENROUTER_API_KEY secret, and LLM_API_BASE set to the OpenRouter API.",
